    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43378" root="لقى" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِقَآءٌ</span></b>  The <i>facing</i> a thing. [<i>encountering it:</i>] and
<i>meeting</i> it, <i>meeting with</i> it, or <i>finding</i> it: and
<i>perceiving</i> it <i>by the sense,</i> and <i>by the sight.</i> (Er-Rághib, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِقَآءٌ</span>: its predominant application is <i>Encounter,</i> i. e. <i>conflict, fight, battle,</i>
or <i>war.</i> (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَوْمُ اللِّقَآءِ</span> <i>The day of
encounter</i> in fight &amp;c.

